      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a sample response aiming for high, natural positivity. \"Thank you so much for bringing this to our attention; we sincerely apologize that your experience did not meet the high standards you expect from Vanguard. We value your feedback immensely as it helps us continually improve our services. Please allow us to look into this specific issue right away and get back to you with a clear resolution within the next few hours.\"",
